@startuml DS_07_Consultar_Tabla_Amortizacion
title DS_07: Diagrama de Secuencia - Consulta de Tabla de Amortizacion de Credito
autonumber
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing true

actor "Cliente / Oficial" as User
boundary "Comercializadora / Core App" as App
control "CreditoResource" as Resource
participant "CreditoService" as Service
database "BanQuito MariaDB" as DB

User -> App: Consulta estado de credito #101
App -> Resource: GET /api/credito/tabla-amortizacion/101
activate Resource

Resource -> Service: obtenerTablaAmortizacion(101)
activate Service

Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM CREDITO WHERE COD_CREDITO = 101
activate DB
DB --> Service: Credito { codCredito: 101, codCliente: 'CLI01', monto: 650.00, plazo: 6, tasa: 0.165, estado: 'ACTIVO' }

Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM AMORTIZACION WHERE COD_CREDITO = 101 ORDER BY NUM_CUOTA ASC
DB --> Service: Lista de 6 Cuotas (numCuota, valorCuota, interesPagado, capitalPagado, saldo)
deactivate DB

Service --> Resource: TablaAmortizacionDTO { credito: {...}, cuotas: [...] }
deactivate Service

Resource --> App: HTTP 200 OK\n{ "codCredito": 101, "monto": 650.00, "plazo": 6, "cuotas": [...] }
deactivate Resource

App --> User: Despliega tabla interactiva con cuotas mensuales, intereses y saldo decreciente

@enduml
